// Per-pill variations. When the user picks a pill the widget shows three
// concrete proposals AI is committing to. Keyed by
// [campaignId][rowKey][pillLabel] = [v1, v2, v3]. rowKey is the row id, or
// 'creative:social' / 'creative:email' / 'creative:sms' for per-channel
// creative variations. Each variation: { label: short imperative or noun,
